in in North Wales. Dominantly if you see a squirrel&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:29.700
in the UK it's going to be a grey squirrel.
So how do we understand that? Well we try and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:34.740
write down interaction equations between the two&nbsp;
squirrel populations. We're going to be looking at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.740 --> 00:00:39.480
