00:01:36.660 --> 00:01:44.520
alpha GR here and beta GR here. Minus alpha GR is&nbsp;
the competition of the grey and the red for the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:49.920
grey squirrels; beta GR is the competition for the&nbsp;
grey and red squirrels for the red. It's how they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:53.520
